'''Ginger Luger''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by [[crafting]] it during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Ginger Luger is a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luger_pistol Luger Pistol]. Its barrel uses a candy cane texture, and the front sight, slide, pin, and trigger resemble small pieces of green candy. Along the top portion of the pistol is sugary white frosting. The whole gun is made out of gingerbread, but the handle’s grip is slightly darker in color.

==Trivia==
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Gingerblade]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ginger_Set_(Godly) Ginger Set].
*Players needed one [[Gingerbread Cookie]], which was obtainable by salvaging [[Gingerblade]], and one [[Gold Bar]], which was obtainable by salvaging [[Luger]], to craft this.
*It was designed by the popular Youtuber JD ([[Thexz]] and [[didi1147]]).<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/2674301358/GB-Luger</ref>
*This is one of the reskins of [[Luger]]. The others are [[Lugercane]], [[Green Luger]], [[Red Luger]], and [[Chroma Luger]].
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/95354288/Luger-Pistol Luger Pistol], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux. However, the texture has been altered to a different color scheme.
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 24, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2674301358/GB-Luger here].

